tion from you settles it.\n- The cancelled status is called Cancelled, since the doc never names it.\n- A guest can cancel from Confirmed, which includes In stay, exactly as the doc words it. I'll flag this as an open point in the reply. A statement from you or the doc that cancelling stops at check-in settles it.\n\n**Still open:** none.\n\nIs this the right reading of the board?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2047,"cache_read_input_tokens":80775,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2047},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c08c67fa-d8e4-4089-af0f-19a3fcf9b2fc","uuid":"abae05ac-66da-455d-8e58-645f163c5e11","timestamp":"2026-10-30T07:37:44.866Z","request_id":"req_011CgY3EedjjsSHZb7Xm1M8T"}
